              "category": "Customer Support",
              "description": "Customer support emails are official messages sent to assist customers with their inquiries, issues, or feedback related to the store’s products, services, orders, or policies. These emails aim to provide timely, clear, and respectful communication that resolves customer concerns and maintains a positive brand relationship.  Support emails may include:  Answers to questions about shipping, returns, or refunds  Order updates or confirmations  Responses to complaints or technical issues  Clarification of store policies or FAQs  Follow-up messages for unresolved issues  Customer support emails must be:  Helpful and accurate (based on verified information)  Polite and professional in tone  Clear and easy to understand, avoiding technical jargon  Responsive, ideally answered within 24–48 hours"
            },
            {
              "category": "Other",
              "description": "Any email that is not customer support related"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
